 ],
 "text": "What if every government on Earth left tomorrow and never came back? Day 1. No new laws, no new taxes, and every group chat goes wild. Day 2. The traffic lights still work. Somebody's code is running them. Day 3. The first people to organize anything are the neighborhood group chats. Week 2. Trash piles up and every city finds out who actually kept things running. Month 1. Businesses with clear systems keep paying people. The ones running on one person's memory stop. Year 1. The new governments are basically group chats with rules and an approval step. Systems beat titles. Want the 5 starter skills I use to run my company? Comment AI and I'll send them to you free."
